  "description": "RUJGUA crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C40 H60 Er4 O20,C7 H8. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er1E (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er1K (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er1N (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.592-3.858 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.02-112.57°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C40H60Er4O20·C7H8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
